# Restricted artifacts (2026-08-19, fifth review round) -- excluded from
# Phase 0's commits (see REPRODUCIBILITY.md Finding 6 and
# docs/PHASE0_RUN_MANIFEST_2026-08-19.json's restricted_artifacts
# section for the hashes/reasons). Listed explicitly, not by wildcard,
# so this file is itself an auditable record of what's excluded and
# why -- a bare `data/*_batches/` pattern would also have silently
# hidden future additions from `git status`, making it too easy to lose
# track of what's actually being kept out. Two categories:
#
#   (a) Raw LLM batch-job caches: per-call request/response JSON dumps.
#       Not needed for reproducibility -- every regression script reads
#       the aggregated *_eval_results.json / *_signals.json / *_verifier_*.json
#       files instead. Excluded pending a size/provenance review, not a
#       privacy one (they typically embed the same student-answer text
#       as (b), which is the sharper concern).
#   (b) Phase-A signal files containing complete, verbatim Mohler
#       dataset student answer text. Excluded because this project has
#       not confirmed the Mohler dataset's license permits
#       redistributing that text. NOTE: data/mohler_real_phaseA_signals.json
#       and data/mohler_real_extension_phaseA_signals.json contain the
#       same category of data and are ALREADY tracked and already
#       pushed to origin/main (commit d21b568, predates this review) --
#       that is a separate, already-public exposure this .gitignore
#       entry does not and cannot retroactively fix; remediating it
#       requires a separate, explicit decision about remote history
#       (see REPRODUCIBILITY.md Finding 6).
data/claude_pipeline_phaseA_batches/
data/claude_pipeline_phaseA_signals.json
data/deepseek_pipeline_phaseA_batches/
data/deepseek_pipeline_phaseA_signals.json
data/deepseek_pipeline_phaseB_batches/
data/deepseek_pipeline_phaseB_batches_pilot20/
data/deepseek_verifier_ablation_batches/
data/deepseek_verifier_skeptical_batches/
data/gpt_pipeline_phaseA_batches/
data/gpt_pipeline_phaseA_signals.json
data/gpt_pipeline_phaseB_batches/
data/gpt_pipeline_phaseB_batches_pilot20/
data/gpt_verifier_ablation_batches/
data/gpt_verifier_skeptical_batches/
data/mohler_real_verifier_corrected_cov_batches/
data/mohler_real_verifier_evidence_removed_batches/
data/mohler_real_verifier_skeptical_batches/
data/mohler_real_verifier_targeted_batches/
